{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>אל ימעט לפניך</b> — The particle את attaches to what is near, not to התלאה, but rather to the noun itself [העצם]. Likewise: את שני האנשים ותצפנו."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "Reading ולא עם התלאה literally; the phrase is grammatically opaque and possibly textually uncertain, but the argument is that את connects with the adjacent word rather than with the more distant התלאה."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:31.975459740Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}